Marker file: Silverstripe skips any directory containing a file of this name when it builds its
manifests (only the file's existence matters, not this text).

Why it is here: the theme manifest registers EVERY directory named "templates" into the $default
theme set, and in test mode module tests/ directories are not ignored. Without this marker the
fixture LoginIcon.ss below would become the login icon in every consuming project's test runs.
The tests reach it only through an explicit theme path, which does not consult the manifest.
